        <mxCell id="hAYHd5z7ZE6wJLWNuexx-5" value="[&quot;Operation Gladio&quot;, &quot;is the codename for&quot;, &quot;a clandestine North Atlantic&#xa;Treaty Organisation (NATO) &#39;stay-behind&#39; operation in Italy during the Cold&#xa;War&quot;, &quot;Operation Gladio is the codename for a clandestine North Atlantic&#xa;Treaty Organisation (NATO) &#39;stay-behind&#39; operation in Italy during the Cold&#xa;War.&quot;]​&#xa;[&quot;Operation Gladio&quot;, &quot;was prepared for&quot;, &quot;armed resistance in the event of a&#xa;Warsaw Pact invasion and conquest&quot;, &quot;Its purpose was to prepare for, and&#xa;implement, armed resistance in the event of a Warsaw Pact invasion and&#xa;conquest.&quot;]​&#xa;[&quot;Operation Gladio&quot;, &quot;is used as an informal name for&quot;, &quot;all NATO stay-&#xa;behind organizations&quot;, &quot;Although Gladio specifically refers to the Italian&#xa;branch of the NATO stay-behind organizations, &#39;Operation Gladio&#39; is used&#xa;as an informal name for all of them.&quot;]​&#xa;[&quot;Gladio&quot;, &quot;is the Italian form of&quot;, &quot;gladius&quot;, &quot;The name &#39;Gladio&#39; is the Italian&#xa;form of &#39;gladius&#39;, a type of Roman shortsword.&quot;]​" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="410" y="348" width="410" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
